{"ts":1793364774923,"event":"done","summary":"Renamed billingUrl->billingEndpoint in @mfe/shared-contracts, released as 2.0.0 (breaking, major bump; PR #1). Shell (#2), billing (#3) and reports (#4) now use billingEndpoint and depend on ^2.0.0 with updated lockfiles; all merged, CI and CD green. Assumptions: reports also used billingUrl (no sub-task) so I updated it too, otherwise it would have broken on the next dependency update and failed the acceptance criterion. PLAT-102-4: platform-kit has no billingUrl reference and does not depend on shared-contracts, so no change/release was made."}
